<title>LITHUANIA: KLASCO'S JAN-APRIL NET PROFIT FALLS SLIGHTLY.</title>
<headline>KLASCO'S JAN-APRIL NET PROFIT FALLS SLIGHTLY.</headline>
<dateline>LITHUANIA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's Klaipeda Stevedoring company (KLASCO) said on Thursday that its net profit during the first four months of the year was 9.13 million litas compared to 10.6 million litas in the same period in 1996.</p>
</text>
